          "body": "## Proposed Changes\r\n\r\nFixes #16769\r\n\r\nAdded comprehensive Playwright E2E test coverage for the Appointments module, closing all outstanding coverage gaps tracked in the Playwright improvement log:\r\n\r\n- **Appointments List (`tests/appointments/appointmentsList.spec.ts`)**:\r\n  - Page loading and appointment list rendering\r\n  - Desktop status tab filtering & mobile select filtering\r\n  - Navigation to appointment details\r\n  - Date filtering and filter persistence across reloads\r\n  - Empty state handling & auto-refresh\r\n- **Appointment Detail (`tests/appointments/appointmentDetail.spec.ts`)**:\r\n  - Appointment details and patient/schedule info verification\r\n  - Check-in action flow and kebab actions menu (fulfill, reschedule, cancel)\r\n  - Appointment status updates\r\n- **Booking Flow (`tests/appointments/bookAppointment.spec.ts`)**:\r\n  - Patient selection, slot/queue selection, and booking confirmation flow\r\n- **Print Layout (`tests/appointments/appointmentPrint.spec.ts`)**:\r\n  - Appointment slip/token layout verification and print loading states\r\n- **Public Appointments (`tests/appointments/publicAppointments.spec.ts`)**:\r\n  - Public booking and slot lookup workflows\r\n- **Helpers & Utilities (`tests/appointments/helpers.ts`)**:\r\n  - Shared API setup helpers (`createAppointmentViaApi`) and fixture utilities\r\n\r\nTagging: @ohcnetwork/care-fe-code-reviewers\r\n\r\n## Merge Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Add specs that demonstrate the bug or test the new feature.\r\n- [ ] Update [product documentation](https://docs.ohc.network).\r\n- [ ] Ensure that UI text is placed in I18n files.\r\n- [ ] Prepare a screenshot or demo video for the changelog entry and attach it to the issue.\r\n- [ ] Request peer reviews.\r\n- [x] Complete QA on mobile devices.\r\n- [x] Complete QA on desktop devices.\r\n- [x] Add or update Playwright tests for related changes\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **Tests**\n  - Added end-to-end coverage for appointment booking, appointment lists, appointment details, printing, cancellation, check-in, and public OTP login.\n  - Added verification for appointment views, filters, status columns, auto-refresh, navigation, empty states, confirmation dialogs, QR codes, and validation messages.\n  - Added test support for creating appointments, schedules, and available booking slots consistently.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
